HYDROGEN DESORPTION FROM MOLYBDENUM
hdesorbmo.nc

     --Version 1.0--
This file is designed to duplicate the desorption model in the old
DEGAS (with h2frac = 1, i.e., all desorption as molecules). With a
yield of -1, this is the "default" PMI. A cosine velocity distribution
is used with a fixed energy equal to 1.5 times the wall temperature.
This file was manually generated from one of the other existing simple
PMI data files.

     --Version 1.1--
Manually fill unused portion of main data table with real_unused and set 
unused fit coefficient for "cosine velocity_vector" to real_undef.

